# Clause — Environment Configuration
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values.
#
# WITHOUT a key: the app runs 100% locally via LocalProvider (rule-based,
#   no network, no AI — all features work but answers are pre-programmed
#   for the demo rental agreement only).
#
# WITH a key: the app upgrades to GeminiProvider — Gemini 2.0 Flash
#   powers all features on ANY document you upload. This is what you
#   want for a real submission.
#
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# The key is SERVER-SIDE ONLY: read in src/app/api/analyze/route.ts,
# never bundled to the client, never logged.

GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=AIzaSy_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY_FROM_AISTUDIO_GOOGLE_COM